From: greyoak111 <151205158+greyoak111@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 17:10:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 36/49] Place the caption box on the canvas, bottom centre by
 default

A "Position on canvas" setting puts the caption box at the bottom
centre (default), top centre, centre, a corner, or leaves it free, at a
set distance from the edge. Resizing keeps the box anchored; moving it by
hand switches the source to free placement so it is never pulled back.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
